(The project leverages a modern JavaScript stack tailored for simplicity and educational) Tj
0 -14 Td
(value. Node.js serves as the runtime environment, enabling the use of JavaScript on the) Tj
0 -14 Td
(server. Express.js provides a minimal yet powerful framework for routing and middleware,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(forming the backbone of HTTP request handling. To render dynamic HTML views, the) Tj
0 -14 Td
(application uses Nunjucks, a logic‑enabled templating engine that keeps presentation logic) Tj
0 -14 Td
(tidy while supporting template inheritance through files such as `layout.njk` and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(`dashboard.njk`.) Tj
