0 -14 Td
(\(ORM\) library that abstracts raw SQL queries into model methods. SQLite's file‑based) Tj
0 -14 Td
(database suits small‑scale personal applications and requires little configuration.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Chart.js powers client‑side visualization, turning API responses into bar charts that) Tj
0 -14 Td
(display spending by category. On the styling front, Bootswatch's Lux theme customizes) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Bootstrap 5, delivering responsive components with minimal effort. Additional dependencies) Tj
0 -14 Td
(include Helmet for security headers, Morgan for logging, body‑parser for form submissions,) Tj
0 -14 Td
